("Q-R01","Which price source may we use for opening and closing lines, and under what licence?","Nothing usable. The official NFL pages read this session (injury report, standings, schedules) carry no prices.","Licensed or official price feed with redistribution terms.","","Blank: no official price source identified","R01, R04, R18, R20, R53","Request licence terms from one or more odds vendors; record licence id, snapshot time and settlement rule."),
("Q-R02","Does the NFL.com terms of use allow systematic retrieval of data for research?","The English terms (updated 16 May 2024).","Written consent, or counsel's reading of §1.3.","Partly answered by text: §1.3 allows only own individual non-commercial and informational use; 'systematic retrieval of data ... to create or compile ... a collection, compilation, database, or directory' is prohibited absent express prior written consent. This is a reading of the text, not legal advice.","Official text: "+TERMS,"R29, R47, R48, R68","Ask the league for written consent, or stop systematic capture and publish derived aggregates only."),
("Q-R03","Does an official source publish depth order for all 32 clubs?","One prior record (club-slot in nfl-book RD-01). The depth-chart route was reported as a 404 in prior records. Not re-tested here.","Per-club official depth pages verified for 32 clubs.","","Blank: not verified in this session","R06, R33, R36, R44, R45","Fetch and verify each club's official depth page; record date and URL per row."),
("Q-R04","What does a blank game-status cell mean?","The live page, read this session: game status is filled on exactly 171 rows and every filled status sits on a row with an injury entry (171 = 171); no row has an injury entry without a status.","The meaning of a blank cell in the page's own text.","Partly answered by pattern only: on this capture, a blank game status occurs only where no injury is listed. The page text read does not define the blank cell.",INJ,"R57, R41","Read the report's help text and the policy page; keep blanks as blanks until defined."),
("Q-R05","Which practice day does the published report describe?","Page titled 'Week 10 of the 2026 Season', read on Sunday 15 Nov 2026.","The day-stamp rule for each capture.","","Blank: the page text read does not state it",  "R21, R47","Capture daily at a fixed UTC time and record the fetch time with each read."),
("Q-R06","How many graded games are needed before a strategy can be rewarded?","Repository convention (prior NFL Book gate): 300 graded games.","An external or owner-approved basis for the 300.","","Blank: repository convention, owner must confirm","R02, R52, R71","Owner decision; pre-register before the first evaluation."),
("Q-R07","May per-game player logs be collected?","Not collected.","Terms decision (see Q-R02).","","Blank: depends on Q-R02","R10, R25, R27","As Q-R02."),
