("Q-R09","Which Week 10 games are final, live or not started, and which clubs are on bye?","Official Week 10 schedule (chunks 0 and 1) and the official 'Teams on Bye' list, read this session.","Nothing material. Final status of games still in progress is a re-check item for the next capture.","Final at capture (9 games, 18 clubs): WAS-NYG, NE-DET, KC-ATL, HOU-CLE, MIN-GB, MIA-IND, CAR-NO, BUF-NYJ, JAX-TEN. Live at capture: SF-DAL (Q3), LAR-ARI (Q4), SEA-LV (Q4). Not started at capture: PIT-CIN (Sun 8:20 PM ET), LAC-BAL (Mon 8:15 PM ET). Teams on bye: CHI, DEN, PHI, TB. 32 - 18 - 4 = 10 clubs not yet final.",W10,"R14, shadow forecasts","Re-read the Week 10 schedule once all 14 games are final."),
("Q-R10","Does the pre-game report carry injuries that happen during the game?","Headlines on the same official report page say Drake Maye (ankle, early in the Patriots game) and Geno Smith (ankle, Jets) were hurt. The captured rows show Maye as Full Participation with no injury entry, and no Jets row for Smith. A Lions headline says Aidan Hutchinson feared a knee injury; no Lions row lists him.","A stated rule from the league.","","Blank: no rule read; observed mismatch only","R21, R48","Record in-game injury news as a separate series."),
